{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16107360","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16107360","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1610736001:1":{"text":"그로웬, 최근에 학생들의 마력이 사라지는 일에 대해 들어본 적 있니?","source_cn":"格墨文，你最近是否听说过学生魔力消失的事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F0E2E967FBC5132","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610736002:1":{"text":"이상한 병에 걸려 마력이 갑자기 모두 사라진 친구들이 있는데, 솔리스 교수님조차 치료하지 못했다는 얘기를 들은 적은 있어요.","source_cn":"听周围同学议论过。据说有些学生得了某种怪病，会导致全身...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9E736A0674BC4E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610736003:1":{"text":"그럼 네 주변에 그런 증상을 보인 학생은 없었고?","source_cn":"只有这些吗？你身边是否有认识的人出现这种症状？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CF20031D5CE3111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610736004:1":{"text":"적어도 제가 아는 친구 중에는 없었어요.","source_cn":"应该没有，我认识的人没有出现过这种病症的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA58B1B45E3627223","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610736005:1":{"text":"흠... 그래, 알겠다. 너는 교우 관계도 좋고, 영향력도 큰 학생이니 혹시 새로운 정보를 알게 된다면 꼭 이 교장 선생님에게 알려주거라.","source_cn":"嗯……我知道了。你在学生中的人缘不错，也有很高的号召力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB1030CAFB8006C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610736006:1":{"text":"네!","source_cn":"好的，雷蒙校长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F397068E0C46FD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雷蒙校长":{"text":"레이먼 교장","source":"雷蒙校长","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格墨文":{"text":"그로웬","source":"格墨文","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}